  "decision": "NO_CHANGE",
  "workflow_yaml": null,
  "rationale": "The workflow already implements the applicable evidence-supported optimizations. P-LIT-CANCEL-STALE (cancel superseded runs) is present via `concurrency` with `cancel-in-progress: true`, partitioned by pull-request number or ref, so a newer push cancels the older run for the same PR/branch. P-LIT-GHA-CACHE (cache dependency downloads) is present via `actions/setup-java@v6` with `cache: 'gradle'`, which caches Gradle dependency downloads. Other patterns do not fit: there is no matrix job for P-LIT-FAIL-FAST, no schedule trigger for P-LIT-IDLE-SCHEDULE/P-LIT-FAIL-SCHEDULE, and this is a single required unit-test job whose full test set must run on each revision, so test/build selection or skipping would reduce required coverage. No further supported, minimal change is warranted.",
  "evidence_ids": ["pattern:P-LIT-CANCEL-STALE", "pattern:P-LIT-GHA-CACHE"]
}
